OL,3,GNEWSACommunity projects recognised with
OL,4,AKing's Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifteen groups across the South West
OL,7,Fhave been given the King's Award for
OL,8,FVoluntary Service.
OL,10,FFour community interest groups and
OL,11,Forganisations from Devon and 11 from
OL,12,FCornwall received the prestigious award
OL,13,Ffor making a difference through
OL,14,Fvolunteering.
OL,16,FClean Our Patch Community Interest
OL,17,FCompany (CIC), a litter-picking group
OL,18,Fin Plymouth which received an award,
OL,19,Fsaid they felt "overwhelmed" and
OL,20,F"elated" to be recognised.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
