OL,3,GNEWSACommunity projects recognised with
OL,4,AKing's Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Cornwall, volunteers at community
OL,7,Fshare shop Bugle Library of Things said
OL,8,Fthe award recognised the contribution
OL,9,Fmade by volunteers whose time,
OL,10,Fcommitment and local knowledge helped
OL,11,Fturn a grassroots community project
OL,12,Finto an organisation.
